From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: banst <bastien@banst.ch>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 22:45:20 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] pod: the Classic's search and queue at 320x240

---
 apps/gui/list.c        |  10 ++-
